  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-11-02T21:33:45.776Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A common need is to get a reasonable measurement of some player's height. Currently the only way to do this is guessing based on bone positions, which is unreliable and not good enough.\n\nVRChat apparently has a good way to determine that height, because it's used for sizing a player's UI capsule as well as fallback avatars. Please expose that information to the PlayerApi for Udon.",
